eAuditEntry treated an unloaded PersistentCollection like an entity\nproxy and read it, so every update of a data set or org unit group loaded\nall of its org units after commit just to list their UIDs in the audit\nentry. This breaks the method's documented rule 2 (\"Do not include any lazy\nHibernateProxy or PersistentCollection that is not loaded\"). A collection\nthe request did not load is now left out; loaded collections are still\nwritten as before.\n\nOn a copy of a production database, changing only the sharing of a data\nset or org unit group with ~138k org units went from 2.7-3.3 s and a\n~1.9 MB audit entry to 0.03-0.16 s and ~1 KB.\n\nBackport of #25534.\n(cherry picked from commit 786822a87e4fd29e6bb56d5b0c62d0223b8cd176)\n\n🤖 AI Assisted","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"6dc74c0285896cac3b6bc4a0aabde4746b316d7a","tree_id":"e5c7b9cf9eb6599c97cf40aacc4c440b172414a7","timestamp":"2026-10-07T05:02:06Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/o